sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant H as Handler
    participant F as Stream hub
    participant S as PageReader
    participant R as Redis
    C->>H: GET ?offset=now and live=sse
    H->>F: acquire exact stream incarnation
    F->>R: SUBSCRIBE and confirm once
    F->>S: bounded durable refresh before ready
    F-->>H: ready
    H->>S: ReadPage(path, offset) · capture snapshot
    S->>R: EVALSHA read.lua · bounded range
    S-->>H: first frame-aligned page + fixed tail
    H-->>C: 200 · Content-Type text/event-stream
    loop pages to the captured tail
        H-->>C: one data event + one control event · flush
        H->>S: next ReadPage with the same snapshot
    end
    H->>F: attach at last flushed control offset
    R-->>F: append wake hint
    F->>S: drain one durable snapshot in bounded pages
    F-->>H: shared immutable data event
    H-->>C: data then client control
    Note over H,F: bounded replay, lagged clients resume
    H-->>C: control streamClosed true → close
